      "text": "now 1-2 GB data is coming in  ----only 3 cpu cores are being utilized (17 cpu are being idle)\n\nmake sure all scenarios 60- 70% resources need to be utilized\n\n1 gb you get 8 partitions ,2gb you see 16 partitions \n\nfor each partitions 1 cpu cores is assigned, \n\n\n\n\n ",
