      "text": "class A:\n   def sum(Self,x,y):\n       self.x=x\n        self.y=y\n        return self.x+self.y\n    \n   def mult(self,c):\n         self.c =c\n          y= self.x*c\n  \nb=A()\nb = sum(10,20)\nb.mult(5)",
